window.products.push({"id":201031,"name":"365FURY Best Coworkers Ever Gifts - Coworkers Gift For Women - Birthday Gifts Idea For Coworkers - Thank You Gift For Coworker - 20Oz Tumbler & Keycha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lNODam4WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CHRISTMAS GIFT FOR COWORKERS: Friends are the family you choose, and co-workers are the family chosen for you by the mysterious forces of capitalism. A \"Best coworker ever\" travel mug and a \"Thank you\" keychain packaged in one lovely gift box is a thoughtful present for your \"sister at work\" on a birthday, work anniversary, promotion, Christmas, or other holidays. Let those with whom you spend most of your time know that they’re special, valued, and more than just “work friends”. ENERGY-BOOSTING GIFT FOR COWORKERS: The foundation of a productive work day for most of us is a cup of something energizing — be it tea, coffee, or just some pristine spring water. What can do better than a tumbler with the insulation function? Brighten up her day with a cup of the drink type she loves and make her smile with the funny but meaningful quote printed on the coffee mug. The Thank you keychain is a plus point to show your gratitude for what she has done to support you. EXQUISITE COWORKER GIFT SET: Gifting to coworkers is the hardest thing to do. You're probably on a stricter budget than your family or BFF, and you may also buy for someone you're not close to. This gift set is all that you need. 5 IN 1 GIFT SET which is worth $50, NOW ONLY $26.95. A tumbler, a lovely keychain, BONUS 2 straws, and a replaced lid packaged in a polite gift box can be straightly given to your desk-mate, surprise and melt her heart. Can't be more affordable for a meaningful gift! FROM QUALITY TO HEALTH: We understand that you are always nervous about the quality of each item to give your friend. Made with 18/8 304 food-grade stainless steel, this travel tumbler is safe for users' health. Furthermore, a Double-wall vacuum inner and outer ensures insulation performance that keeps drinks hot for 6 hours & cold for 12 hours. This practical coffee mug can keep your colleague hydrated all day with her favorite drinks. PORTABLE TRAVEL TUMBLER: Our coffee mugs are designed to be portable and fit in most cup holders so your coworker can take them anywhere. Whenever she uses this \"Best Coworker Ever\" tumbler, while working, doing OT, meeting, even exercising, cooking, hanging out with friends, or in any daily activity, she will be reminded of your care and respect. Bonus a set of straw, cleaner, and a replacement lid, now it is easy to clean it and use it in many ways with 2 different functional lids.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lNODam4WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"365FURY","source_asin":"B0BK1LQFR4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-201031","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK1LQFR4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK1LQFR4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
