window.products.push({"id":201183,"name":"Ice Packs Replacement for Coolers, One Reusable Ice Packs, Fast Freeze & Long Lasting Freezer Packs for Lunch Containers, Backpack, Cooler Fan, Picnic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HKYeyTnTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❆【Large Efficient Cold Ice Packs】The FANCOLE ice pack set is composed of 1pcs large-size, non-toxic, BPA-Free plastic ice packs. Built-in soluble ice crystal gel particles can be reused, once filled with water to the MAX for the first time, no need to change the water then! Keep food fresh and ideal ice pack for kids' lunch boxes or bentos. ❆【Long Last and Reusable】Freeze the ice packs in advance for maximum cooling power. The ice box will become extremely hard and cold after 3-4 hours. Pack these freezer packs with your food when you need to go out for work or school, they can effectively keep food cool and fresh before you eat. These reusable ice packs are built to last, just put these packs back in the freezer again for your next time use. ❆【Summer Coolers' Secret】In the hot summer, is the normal air cooler no longer able to meet your cooling needs? Try these FANCOLE ice packs with your air cooler. You will know what the real coolness is. With the ice packs in the air cooler, you will experience an unprecedented chill wind, as if you are in a world of ice and snow. ❆【Portable & Space-Saving Design】These large ice packs are sized to fit any bags, which measures 7.08\" x 4.72\" x 1.18\" and are perfect for lunch bags, beach bags, picnic baskets, etc. 1-pack hard-sided rectangular ice packs easy to put your backpack for temporary refrigeration of food, beverages, perishables, first-aid of sprain, pain or injury. ❆【Super Versatile Freezer Packs】Perfect home freezer packs to keep food fresh and drinks fresh without the ice melting. Ideal ice packs for lunch boxes and coolers, take to the school, office, picnics, camping, hiking, fishing, and more. Recommended to hand wash the ice packs before each use, and keep it dry by air or a soft cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HKYeyTnTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"fancole","source_asin":"B09WVCGL4Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-201183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WVCGL4Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WVCGL4Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
