window.products.push({"id":201199,"name":"Goodful Stainless Steel Collapsible Telescoping Straws With Silicone Tips, Portable and Reusable Straw Set with Carry Bag and Cleaning Brush, 2 Pack, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ow14MOuQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy beverages on the go without the guilt of using disposable straws with every sip you take. With these Goodful stainless steel collapsible straws, you can easily tote these high-quality straws with you wherever you go. The straws collapse to easily store inside the included drawstring carry bag, so this straw set can easily fit in any purse, backpack or pocket for on-the-go convenience. The straws telescope to be the perfect height for any glass, bottle or cup- tall or short, so you will always have the right size straw with you. The soft silicone tops are comfortable to sip from, keeping your teeth and lips from touching the stainless steel. The best part? These straws are easy to clean! Place the in the top rack of the dishwasher or use the included cleaning brush while out and about to clean these straws fast and easy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ow14MOuQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Goodful","source_asin":"B08P9QWLPH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-201199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P9QWLPH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P9QWLPH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":201200,"name":"(12Pack x 12 Sets) STACK'nGO Cupcake Carriers - Sturdy Strong High Tall Dome Containers Plastic Disposable Storage Boxes Dozen Compartments Slots Hold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.92,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91I6BzhVq5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧁 STRONG & STURDY: Don’t be fooled by imitations. Unlike other plastic cupcake containers that are flimsy, too thin and weak, our crystal clear 12 Compartment Cupcake Carriers are superior because they use the thickest strongest yet lightest material possible. Sturdy enough to hold 12 full sized cupcakes with just one hand without bending or collapsing 🧁 ANTI-CRUSH TECHNOLOGY: Family and friends are depending on you to deliver those delicious masterpieces. You need to protect them by all means. That's why we engineered support columns that can withstand 25 pounds of direct vertical pressure. So if that watermelon, in the trunk, rolls on the tray - NO WORRIES - your high frosted treasures will be perfectly intact. Phew!!! 🧁 PREMIUM QUALITY = NO STRESS + LESS MESS: Fill, Stack’n Go with confidence. We are committed to delivering the best quality products and customer service. These STURDY 12 Cupcake Holders are superior to the competition and are the world’s strongest containers backed our unmatched No Risk Guarantee. 🧁 NO RISK, JUST WHISK GUARANTEE: Fast SMS & Email Support. With over 1,100+ FIVE star reviews, we are confident you will love your sturdy containers. If by chance you are not satisfied, contact us and we’ll give you your money back, no questions asked. 🧁 LOVED BY MOMS & BAKERIES - You kids/customers deserve the best. BPA Free and Food Safety Approved these trays are lightweight and disposable (please recycle) yet sturdy enough to be reused time and time again with a light washing. 🧁 SAVE TIME & MONEY: The party is getting late and your kids just had their 3rd sugar rush meltdown. It's time to go. NOW! We've all been there. Well now you don't have to stress out if you forgot to grab one of the cupcake cases. It's NP because they are so affordable plus you have more at home. 🧁 BAKE THE WORLD A SWEETER PLACE: a portion of all profits are donated to end child hunger.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91I6BzhVq5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cakes of Eden","source_asin":"B0BTPL8DHX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-201200","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTPL8DHX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTPL8DHX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
