window.products.push({"id":201225,"name":"Wine Decanter Drying Stand with Rubber Coated Top to Prevent Scratches, Wine Decanter Drying Rack for Standard Large Bottomed Wine Decanters, Includes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DDpDOci-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💝【Keep Your Decanters Looking Best】This wine decanter drying stand hangs the decanter upside down for drying and cleaning to prevent pooled water and drip spots. Keep your decanters looking their best, so your wine can be presented and enjoyed at its best! (Decanter NOT Included ) 💝【Fits Standard Decanters & 2 Sizes Cleaning Brushes】The decanter drying stand measures 9.45\" tall, with a 7.48\" diameter bottom base, and a 5.31\" diameter inside top. The decanter drying rack is also a great decanter display rack, looking great in home decor. The brushes' sizes: 42.5 cm/ 16.7 inch, 26 cm/ 10.2 inch, feature long and short styles to meet your different needs. 💝【Premium Material & Reusable】The wine drying stand's stainless steel construction won’t rust or bend. Rubber coating around the inner protects the decanter from scratching, stable and safe. The brush is made of quality foam, which is flexible and firm to use, the cleaning beads are made of stainless steel, comes with uniform friction with the inner wall of the container without damage, safe and reusable. 💝【Latest Upgrade Combination】The decanter drying rack is matched with 2 cleaning brushes and a box decanter cleaning beads. The cleaning brushes remove internal stains, dirt, dust, and residues on decanters, narrow neck goblets, water bottles, glasses, cups; the cleaning beads remove hard-to-reach stains from the tricky corners. The classic and fashionable wine decanter drying rack is suitable for any occasion. (Decanter NOT Included) 💝【Best Gift】 With an elegant look and its unique functions, the wine decanter stand set is a perfect gift for all wine lovers, your family, and friends, thoughtful housewarming, Thanksgiving, Christmas, birthday, holiday gift, or wedding gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DDpDOci-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QPIX DIGITAL","source_asin":"B0C69MWZLG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-201225","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C69MWZLG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C69MWZLG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
