window.products.push({"id":201270,"name":"FINERFIBER Velvet High Stretch 2 Piece Armchair Slipcover | Thick Couch Cover for Pets | Couch Covers for 1 Cushion Couch | Furniture Protector for Se","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SNi80yHuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GREAT FIT: This innovated 2 Piece sofa couch cover, made from luxurious velvet plush fabric, is especially designed for sofas with separate cushions. It includes 1 base cover, 1 seperate cushion cover and anti-slip foam strips. The slipcover fits an Armchair with sitting width between 32-48 inch. Highly recommended for both leather and fabric sofa. EASY TO USE - STAYS IN PLACE: SPECIAL FEATURES - With its Anti-Slip Foam Strips, the slipcover can easily be tucked into the grooves to make the fabric tighter and wrinkle-free. NEW elastic straps located on the bottom edges, together with the elasticized bottom, will secure the slipcover and make it stay in place firmly. The separate cushion covers will ensure that your couch stays fully covered all the time with no shifting or moving. (detailed installation guide included in package). SUPREME QUALITY AND COMFORT – Made from superior quality materials, the luxurious silky velvet makes it very comfortable and cozy to sit on. The thick velvety fabric is extremely stretchy and durable, and will last for years to come. Our slipcovers are extensively investigated in the laboratory to make sure that the color does not bleed or fade and that the stitches are meticulously sewn and do not tear. PROTECTION – Great for homes with children and pets! Our couch cover will protect your couch from spills, stains, and daily wear. Our sofa covers are also great couch covers for dogs and couch protector from cats. Your sofas are definitely safe from being ruined and you get to keep the adorable furry ones inside your home! EASY MAINTENANCE –Our covers are machine washable and can be put in the dryer. Gentle cycle and tumble dry low. Do Not Bleach. Check out more styles of our huge selection of FINERFIBER slipcovers, all sizes and colors!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SNi80yHuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FINERFIBER","source_asin":"B09G6MWKZW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-201270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G6MWKZW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G6MWKZW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":201271,"name":"English Bulldog Pattern Oven Mitts and Pot Holders Set Kitchen Gift Set for Kitchen Cooking Baking BBQ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cJ+Oj1aoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do You Feel That A Pot Holder And An Oven Mitt Both Are Useful In Their Own Way & Prove Handy In Different Situations? You’re Confident That The Thanksgiving Dinner You’ve Put Together Is The Greatest Your Family Has Seen In Years. The Turkey Is Baking, The Green Bean Casserole Right Next To It, And The Pumpkin Pie Sits On The Cooling Rack By The Counter. Now, None Of This Would Be Possible Without Your Functional Oven, Or You Of Course, But It Also Wouldn’t Be Possible Without Your Oven Mitts Or Pot Holders! You Need High Heat Protection And A Strong Grip To Hoist The Turkey Into The Oven. A Great Cook, Such As Yourself, Deserves Great Kitchen Supplies.Safety With Flexibility – This Unique Set Of A Pot Holder And An Oven Mitt Not Only Helps You Handle Hot Pots, Pans, Plates, Casseroles But Also Offers You The Best Of Both The Worlds! It Cannot Be Denied That For Some Tasks Oven Gloves Are A Better Choice While Kitchen Pot Holders Excel At Some Other, And Both Of Them Used Together Can Do Wonders – Be It Pulling A Baking Tray From The Oven Or Picking A Hot Utensil Directly From The Stove – Achieve Pro-Like Dexterity!Ideal Gift – Struggling To Find A Good Gift For A Friend, Family Member Or A Colleague Who Loves Cooking? This Set Makes For An Ideal Choice, And Experience Tells Us That You Can Never Go Wrong With It – Be It Any Festive Occasion Or Just A Casual Gift.Easy To Clean – Safe For Machine Wash Too .Note – It Is Recommended To Use Cold Water For Washing The Mitt & Pot Holder, And That Too In A Gentle Cycle With Tumble Drying On Low. It Is Also Advisable Not To Bleach Them Or Run Them Through A Hot Dryer!Package IncludingGood Kitchen Cooking Helper, Ideal Housewarming, Thanksgiving Day, Birthday, Christmas, Mother'S Day GiftsMaterial: Polyester + Quilted Insulated CottonPattern: UniqueHeat Resistant To: Less Than 180℃ / 356℉Care: Keep Away From Naked Flame","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cJ+Oj1aoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KZEMATLI","source_asin":"B08JYGK19D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-201271","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JYGK19D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JYGK19D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
