window.products.push({"id":201456,"name":"JJDANFILL Bamboo Piilow Queen Size, Shredded Memory Foam Adjustable Pillows, Firm Pillow for Sleeping, Bed Pillow for Side Back Stomach Sleepers with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817KtUWJQVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【JJDANFILL 2 Pack Pillows】Shredded memory foam pillows are filled with CertiPUR-US certified memory foam plus lightweight polyester fiber and comes with a 40% bamboo viscous and 60% polyester pillow cover. The breathable pillowcase keeps you dry and cools all night, high-quality memory foam offering exceptional resilience, durability. ✅【Adjustable Height For All Sleepers】Zippers design allows you to customize your comfort in your need. An best choice for side, stomach, and back sleepers. This bamboo pillow fits the curve of your cervical spine and slow rebound foam support to your neck and head, Provide a maximum comfort feeling for every sleeping position. ✅【Machine Washable & Easy to Care】Our hypoallergenic bamboo pillowcase has undergone rigorous machine wash tests. And fade-resistant and stain-resistant fabric makes it always look fresh and new! Zipper design makes it easy to disassemble and wash. You can wash it in the machine with cold water and a gentle cycle, and dry it at low temperature. ✅【OEKO Tex Certified】Our pillowcase is tested under OEKO Tex Standard 100 for harmful chemicals and allergens. And the pillow has the legal standard certification that can be officially sold in the United States. You can rest assured they are safe for long-term use. ✅【After-Sales Service】We believe in the good quality of our cooling pillows. We also focus on providing the best buy experience to the customer. If you don’t fall in love within 100 nights, contact us directly to return the pillow for a full refund, no questions asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817KtUWJQVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JJDANFILL","source_asin":"B097MHPS57","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-201456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097MHPS57","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097MHPS57","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":201457,"name":"PACIFIC MERCHANTS Trading Acaciaware 15-Inch Oval Bowl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41iU40G-ViL._AC_.jpg","description":"Acaciaware by Pacific Merchants offers unusual shapes, hand turned from one solid piece of acacia hardwood and carved by local artisans, making each piece a unique work of art; Acacia hardwood is perfect for salad bowls, pasta bowls, appetizer plates, serving trays, chargers, chip and dips, and dipping bowls. Mix and match for your own customized table setting; Acaciaware by Pacific Merchants (with its rich beautiful grain) is ecologically forested from privately owned lands, strictly managed by local government agencies. Acacia wood is a naturally resinous hardwood, which means it repels water, will not absorb stains or odors and is easy care; Just hand wash with warm soapy water and air dry. Acacia wood won’t crack or dry out, but is not dishwasher or microwave safe. Take care of your elegant Acaciaware by Pacific Merchants and your acacia hardwood serving piece will last for years and years;","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41iU40G-ViL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PACIFIC MERCHANTS","source_asin":"B008AUC1WC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-201457","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008AUC1WC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008AUC1WC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
