window.products.push({"id":201476,"name":"Roll Out 70mm Rubber Bed Slat Holders Strips (Pair)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iudSeAXBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These 70mm Roll out Rubber Bed Slat Holders can be used on a wide range of bed frames. They are ideal for beds that sometimes need to be put away. Ideal for use in Caravans, Campervans or Boats. Any environment when the beds are not in constant use. These roll out bed slats holders will house 70mm x 8mm Beech Sprung Bed Slats. Each strip has 16 opening for the Sprung Bed slats to go into. The gap between each Sprung slat is approximately 50mm. The total Length of the strip that spans the length of the bed is approximately 2000mm. Any Small Single 2ft6 or Single 3ft bed will require one set of holders (2 Strips) Any Double 4ft6, King 5ft or Super King 6ft bed will require two set of holders (4 Strips). These Roll out Bed slat holders are extremely popular especially with our Australia based customers. We also welcome trade enquiries for this product, Please email us for volume discounts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iudSeAXBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Bed Slats Company","source_asin":"B07HB1T8DC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-201476","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HB1T8DC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HB1T8DC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":201477,"name":"CALA Futon Couch Cover,Couch Covers for Dogs,Sofa Covers for 3 Cushion Couch,Furniture Protector with Elastic Straps,Futon Slipcover Throw for Pets, K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619DrylvdWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"CALA brand specialized in household items,dedicated to bringing high quality and comfortable product to you. This slipcover shields and protects your furniture from spills, stains, wear and tear to prevent it from getting ruined. It’s great for homes with children and pets, or for anyone seeking an economical solution for furniture protection. WHAT SIZE SHOULD I ORDER? We HIGHLY RECOMMEND measuring before ordering as every piece of furniture is unique and we want you to be happy with the fit. You can find a detailed measuring guide in the photos as follows: Sofa Oversized: seat width up to 78\" Futon: seat width up to 70\" Sofa: seat width up to 68\" Loveseat: seat width up to 46\" Recliner: seat width up to 30\" Chair: seat width up to 21\" HOW CAN I BE SURE THE PROTECTOR WILL STAY IN PLACE CALA Futon covers feature the newest design which have both two loops on the front and back of the sofa cover and four straps. There are two ways to use it: *1.FASTEN PROTECTOR FROM FRONT TO BACK.* Tie strap through front loop-Go through under seat-Tie strap through back loop.(Refer to the picture above) *2.FASTEN THE FOUR SIDES.* The front and back four loops of the sofa cover are bundled with the four footrests of the sofa. It can reduce slipping,keep sofa cover stay in place. Please note, minor adjustments will be needed with rowdy dogs and kids.If you are looking for great and cost-effective way of re-inventing the function and protect your sofa, this is the way! CAN I PUT THIS IN THE WASHING MACHINE? Of course. This couch cover is machine washable and dryer safe. Directions are included with the cover. IF I ORDER IT AND IT DOES’S FIT, CAN I RETURN IT? Absolutely. We want you to be happy. If you are not happy for any reason (even after Amazon return window), please reach out to us directly for a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619DrylvdWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAZY CALA LIFE","source_asin":"B07DGX9945","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-201477","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DGX9945","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DGX9945","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
