window.products.push({"id":201650,"name":"Bluemoon Homes Duvet Covers Queen Size Egyptian Cotton 1000 Thread Count Luxurious 1 Duvet Cover 2 Pillow Shams Solid Pattern - 3 PC Duvet Cover Set T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OJ3c6TM+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<p>★ PURE 100% EGYPTIAN COTTON DUVET COVER SET – Do you love the luxury and quality of five-star Hotel duvets? Now you can bring your premium travel experience home with our 1000-thread-count, Egyptian cotton duvet cover sets. We rely on yarns made with 100% long staple cotton fiber and a smooth sateen finish. Our eco-friendly duvet covers retain softness for a lifetime and resist fading. From boys’ duvets in classic hues to king duvets in show stopping patterns. <br></p> <p>★ QUEEN / FULL SIZE VIBRANT 3-PIECE SET – Each set includes a 90\" x 90\" Duvet Cover in pure 100% Egyptian cotton and 2 matching Pillow Shams, 20\" x 30\". Each duvet cover features internal ties to make slippage and wrestling with your comforter a thing of the past. If you prefer wrinkle resistant bedding, no worries. Just use a short dry cycle and pull your linens from the dryer right when it ends. Our duvet covers are machine washable, quick dry, and crafted to stay vibrant. </p> <p>★ EASY CARE - No ironing needed. Machine washable. Comfort duvet cover becomes softer after every wash. The features of the egyptian cotton fabric are a great strength and durability. RESISTANT TO SHRINK, FADE AND TEAR, tough enough to withstand frequent washer and dryer cycles.</p> <p>★ ELEGANT AND VIBRANT: Slip this protective layer over your comforter, blanket or duvet insert instead of a top sheet. Useful and practical, the duvet cover secures with buttons and is easy to remove and wash. Our fabulous selection of vibrant colors won’t fade after washing and are a beautiful, elegant way to update your bedroom.</p> <p>★ 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Welcome to the Bluemoon Homes Bedding family! Every purchase includes a 100% money-back satisfaction guarantee. Our #1 goal is to provide you with unparalleled customer service and we’re only happy if our customers are happy! Shop with confidence because no matter what, we’ve got you covered!</p>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OJ3c6TM+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bluemoon Homes","source_asin":"B083GWHCM4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-201650","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083GWHCM4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083GWHCM4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
