window.products.push({"id":201673,"name":"Ougual 50 Pieces Fiber Reed Diffuser Replacement Refill Sticks for Aroma Fragrance (Blue, 12\" x3mm)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PTzDsFn1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Perfect Look: Exactly same kind：the same color，style，and size.Free of flash and won't bend. Bring out your texture of the diffuser set. The Color Never Run: Our colored fibre diffuser sticks do not bleed color in both of oil base & water base diffuser liquid. We have advanced technology to produce colored fibre diffuser sticks do not bleed color in both of oil base and water base diffuser liquid. Easy to Use: Simply place fiber sticks into diffuser bottle,  the oil will saturate into sticks, and as it wicks up it will release the aroma into the air. Specification: Material: Polyester ItemSize: 30cm x 3mm Diameter Color: As Picture Assorted Available: 50 Pcs Instructions: The composition of essential oils (oil-based, water-based or otherwise) and their activity are the most fundamental causes of their diffuse effects.  You may need to determine the quantity or material (fiber or natural reed) of the diffuser sticks based on the active properties of the essential oil. The diffuse effect of the fiber is generally better than the natural reeds.  If the properties of the essential oil do not match the diffuse sticks, there will be diffuse too fast or no diffuse. Recommendations: This fiber sticks has a strong auxiliary diffusing effect, and if your essential oil has strong activity, it may easily diffuse dry. Therefore, it is recommended that you insert fewer fiber rods into the diffuse essential oil bottle at the beginning, increasing or decreasing the number of inserted fiber sticks according to the concentration of the scent.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PTzDsFn1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ougual","source_asin":"B07778DHW9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-201673","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07778DHW9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07778DHW9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
