window.products.push({"id":201689,"name":"Shark QU202Q DuoClean Slim Upright Vacuum (Renewed) (Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21eLzXQj+CL._AC_.jpg","description":"We all know that \"speed-cleaning your apartment before mom comes\" should be an Olympic sport. With this refurbished Shark DuoClean Powered Lift-Away Upright Vacuum, you'll be tackling those tough messes in no time.Not only will your carpets and floors look clean, but they'll actually be clean, too. This bagless vacuum keeps dust and dander locked away using a Complete Seal Technology. This technology features a filter to filter out and trap dirt, dust, dander and other allergens.The Lift-Away technology makes toting this lightweight vacuum around as easy. Just lift the vacuum pod from the floor nozzle and you're ready to take your vacuum anywhere. This upright vacuum cleaner also helps you see crumbs hiding under tables with built-in LED headlights.Keep your floors clean and your dust bunnies where they belong with the Shark QU202Q Powered Lift-Away Upright Vacuum.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21eLzXQj+CL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon Renewed","source_asin":"B09JDVFWW5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-201689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JDVFWW5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JDVFWW5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":201690,"name":"[Upgraded Larger Capacity] Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set - USB Rechargeable One Hand Operation Automatic Pepper Grinder and Salt Grinder with A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619m5P5TpIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Larger Capacity] While keeping the original function, we have increased the capacity of the transparent container from 20.5g to 46g, making it easier for you to add more seasoning at once. [Type-C Fast Charging] TOMEEM rechargeable salt and pepper grinder set can grind more than 60g of spices if fully charged. Coming with a Type-C charger for quick charging, there’s no needs for preparing batteries any more. Fitted with charging indicator intimately, it’ll easily let you know when to go charging for the grinders. [6-Level Adjustable Coarseness] Equipped with high hardness ceramic grinder, TOMEEM Electric Salt & Pepper Grinder Set is best choice for releasing the original aromas of the spices while grinding. 6 Coarseness settings are provided for kitchen lovers grinding spices from coarse to fine, meeting the vast majority of culinary needs. [Easy One-Handed Operation] Grinding is just a matter of pressing a button! There’s also a soft and warm yellow LED light on while working so that seasonings can be seen clearly after being ground. This electric salt and pepper grinder set with LED light is friendly to children, the elders and those who have arthritis, especially people busy meal preparations. [Cool Kitchen Gadget Gift] Grinding spices including black pepper, white pepper, salt, Himalayan salt, red pepper flakes, rosemary, anise seeds, flax seeds, and cumin seeds effortlessly, TOMEEM electric pepper grinders for spices and seeds are also perfect gifts for your chef and cook friends. [Modern Salt and Pepper Shakers] TOMEEM premium salt and pepper grinders are made of food grade PC material and ceramic for grinding core, making this spice mills set a kitchen must have for indoor and outdoor dining. Together with a simple style of design and fine box, this black shakers set is wonderfully thoughtful gift for wedding registry, birthdays, Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, anniversaries, Christmas Day and New Year. [100% Satisfaction Guarantee] Our TOMEEM Customer Service Team take customers’ satisfaction as top goal. Any problems please feel free to contact us, we’d be very happy to help in 24 hours. An extra 6-month warranty is also provided once ordered for worry-free shopping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619m5P5TpIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOMEEM","source_asin":"B0C652Z8SJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-201690","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C652Z8SJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C652Z8SJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
