window.products.push({"id":201760,"name":"MOFANG FAMILY Queen Size Sheets Set, 6 PC Hotel Luxury Extra Soft Microfiber 1800 Thread Count Premium Bed Sheets, Deep Pockets, Hypoallergenic, Wrink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NmrC0NQSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect Fit For Your Bed: Queen Size Luxury 6 Piece Bed Sheets Set includes 1 flat sheet 90\"x102\", 1 fitted sheet 60\" x 80\", 4 pillowcases 20\"x30\". They fit mattresses up to around 16 inches deep. If your mattress is 16 inches(or smaller than 16 inches) it will fit just fine. A gripping all-around elastic band can hold them in place. It will never slide no matter how you twist and turn in your bed. Also available in Twin, Twin XL, Full, King and California King sizes. Super Soft & Ultimate Comfort: MOFANG FAMILY sheets are made of 1800 Series Double Brushed microfiber fabrics and woven with the most exquisite craftsmanship. They are softer than most Egyptian cotton sheets and at a fraction of the cost. Breathable, cool and silky bed sheets make you feel extremely comfortable. Best for any room in your house - bedroom, guest room, kids room, RV, vacation home. Wrinkle & Fade Resistant: Highest quality brushed microfiber has good wrinkle resistance and shape retention, as well as high strength and elastic recovery. Say goodbye to wrinkles, and tedious tasks like ironing, and hello to smooth, soft, and comfortable bedding! Our luxury sheets also have excellent durability, resistant to fading, staining, and shrinking. They are machine washable in cold water and dry quickly on tumble, durable than cotton sheets. Health Sleep Environment: Our bed sheets are specially designed for relaxing and restorative nights. They are not treated with harsh and harmful chemicals and do not leave a strong smell, so you can sleep peacefully. Our bedding sheets are hypoallergenic, those with sensitive skin or conditions like eczema and rest in a safe environment instead of being further irritated at night. A better sleeping environment can lead to better sleep which science shows can lead to better health. Best Gift: Sleep better and wake up each morning feeling refreshed and full of energy. MOFANG FAMILY sheets is a wonderful sleeping gift for ANY HOLIDAYS (Christmas, Thanksgiving Day, Halloween, Valentine's Day, New Year's Day, Easter Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Birthday); ANYONE YOU CARED (kids, parents, lovers, friends) give your loved ones the all-natural sleep and wake up healthy and pleasant.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NmrC0NQSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOFANG FAMILY","source_asin":"B099WRYG65","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-201760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099WRYG65","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099WRYG65","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
