window.products.push({"id":201789,"name":"8 Pack Fridge Organizer with Egg Holder, PBA-Free Refrigerator Organizer Bins with Lids, Stackable Plastic Pantry Organizer Bins for Kitchen, Countert","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QPVOObL1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"「8 Pack Pantry Storage Containers」 The 8pcs fridge organizer helps you store fruits, vegetables, yogurt, cheese, and meat in the fridge, freezer, cabinets, or deep pantry shelves. Keep your cluttered refrigerator, freezer, countertop, kitchen cabinets, or pantry clean and neatly organized with these space-saving clear plastic storage bins 「Ideal Fridge Organizer with Egg Holder」 The set includes an egg holder and is equipped with 15 slots to hold 15 eggs, holding the eggs firmly to avoid bruising or damage. The stackable design allows you to stack them over or under other items with no fear of breaking your eggs. The large container can store lettuce, carrot, and other veggies; 2 medium containers are perfect for cucumber; 4 small containers are perfect for strawberries, grapes, and other fruits, space-saving & no odor 「Strong Construction」Clear plastic food storage bin with an easy-grip side handle allows you to move it with ease, and easy to pull off shelves, cabinets, and closets. Made of high-quality shatterproof BPA-free PET material that has an impact strength of 3-5 times higher than standard bins, these are tough and designed for long-term use. Clean with warm (NOT HOT) soapy water. NOT DISHWASHER SAFE, DO NOT MICROWAVE or OVEN 「Stackable & Drain Tray Design」 Stackable design to help maximize your refrigerator storage space. The lids of fridge containers are not airtight and can effectively prevent dust and odors. The bottom of the large vegetable storage containers for the refrigerator has a drain hole that can be easily opened to drain excess water after washing vegetables and fruits, preventing moisture and keeping them fresh 「Transparent Design & Warranty」The kitchen organizer refrigerator holder bins are clear, so you can see what you want without having to take the whole bin out of the fridge. Simplify your kitchen storage and make room for new. We are dedicated to addressing any product issues, if you ever have any problem, just contact us for help or a free replacement","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QPVOObL1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YKIOKE","source_asin":"B0BZNTS49X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-201789","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZNTS49X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZNTS49X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
