window.products.push({"id":201893,"name":"Uttermara Kids Weighted Blanket 5lbs, Dinosaur Fleece Blanket for Kids with 5 Color Options, Ultra Soft and Cozy Kids Blanket, Great for Calming and S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K+SvxNoAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Better Sleep Achieved Effortlessly: Studies show that children’s physical and mental development is closely related to their sleep quality.Uttermara fleece unicorn weighted blanket holds your little ones gently to calm them down for an all-natural sleep so they could deal with daily activities at home, school or day-care effectively and grow their stress levels. Soft Fabric for Added Comfort and Warmth: Both sides are made of Fleece fabric to keep your little ones warm and cozy even in cold winter. Smooth to the touch, this fabric can be machine washed without any deformation, pilling or shedding. Safe and friendly fuzzy Dinosaur weighted blanket for kids. Popular Dinosaur Pattern: Dinosaur has been a quite popular cartoon character among children for a long time. Conforming to this trend, our weighted blanket is printed with dinosaur, forest, clouds integrating almost all the elements from a child’s dream thanks to the digital printing process which provides both long-lasting and stylish colors. Even and Stable Body Pressure Design: Apply the cutting-edge 7-layer structure with the nontoxic and odorless glass beads in the middle covered by 3 layers of anti-leakage protection respectively so that the weight is evenly distributed. Additionally, the smaller 4 x 4 inches pocket design locks the glass beads securely in place. Customized for Children at Different Weights: In order to enjoy all the benefits of a weighted blanket, it should perfectly fit the kid’s body and weigh about 10% of the child’s weight. The fleece weighted blankets 5lbs 36”x48” are the ideal weighted blankets for children weighing 30 to 60 lbs. Our fleece weighted blanket comes with different sizes for use of kids at different weights. Additionally, we offer lifetime warranty and 30 days refund guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K+SvxNoAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Uttermara","source_asin":"B0BF4KLHBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-201893","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF4KLHBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF4KLHBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
